        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Imprison Mind"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(mental, necromancy, occult)\n\nThe blackfrost prophet concentrates on a creature within 60 feet, filling the target's mind with befuddling susurrations. The creature must succeed at a DC 28 Will save or take 4d8+8 mental damage and become stupefied 1 for 1 minute (stupefied 2 on a critical failure). The creature is slowed 1 as long as it's stupefied."
            },
